SUMMARY:Second Saturday Salons at Jeffrey Burroughs
DESCRIPTION:The Art of Second Saturdays \nOn the second Saturday of each month\, we host a salon at the boutique. \nThese open-house gatherings offer a first look at new collections\, one-of-a-kind pieces\, and evolving ideas within the world of Jeffrey Burroughs. From jewelry debuts to fragrance releases\, each salon is a moment of discovery. \nEnjoy light bites\, champagne\, and a more intimate way to experience the work. \nNo RSVP required. Simply join us.
