SUMMARY:Drop In Mother's Day Collage Fun
DESCRIPTION:This is a drop in class for anyone – but best with two people. Time depends on you and how fast you create. 10 min.\, 20 min\, an hour? Bring your mom\, dad\, daughter\, son\, besties\, etc Create a gift 6 X 6″ collage showing another person how much they mean to you. \nNo charge; donations suggested for materials costs. First come\, first serve until materials run out. \nI provide…everything! Boards\, scissors\, glues\, ribbons\, papers\, markers\, pens\, sparkly things! \nYou provide … Any keepsake or personal item (light weight) that may mean something to your collage partner. \n(No registration; activity ends when materials run out.)
