SUMMARY:Creativity Journaling Sessions
DESCRIPTION:Explore the use of journaling and meditation in accessing deeper levels of creative imagination and inspiration. The root of creativity lies in the murky waters of deep imagination. Through journaling and meditation\, we explore the shy song within—the quiet impulse that wants to emerge in our creative work..
