SUMMARY:Flame Shop: 30 Minute Make Your Own
DESCRIPTION:Receive a guided experience to create your own glass keepsakes in our flameworking studio. In this hands-on class\, you will work one-on-one with an experienced instructor to create a unique piece of glass art. Choose between crafting a marble\, mushroom\, pendant\, or glass icicle\, then customize your piece with your choice of two colors. Your instructor will walk you through all the basic skills you will need to create a keepsake of your very own. Manipulating rods of glass\, you will learn to apply the colors of your choice\, and revel in the exhilaration of melting glass! All levels welcome. \nIf you would like to share this experience with others\, please book consecutive time slots for you to each create works of your own. 2 spectators are welcome free of charge.
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/flame-shop-30-minute-make-your-own/2026-05-13/
LOCATION:North Carolina Glass Center\, 140 Roberts Street\, Asheville\, 28805
CATEGORIES:Classes
