SUMMARY:Plant Club Pop-Up Market
DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy The Canopy at Art Garden AVL\, grab a yummy drink from The Pot Stirred\, and check out local growers and makers of all things plantie: from rare tropicals to native medicinals\, handmade pots and trellises to botanical watercolor paintings\, cut flower bouquets to herbal salves and teas\, and more! \nFollow us on IG @artgardenavl to see our vendor list each month! \nPop-up market features 6-10 local plant vendors on the 3rd Saturday of each month\, from 11 am – 3 pm. \nThis market is free to attend.
