SUMMARY:Small & Mighty Flowers with Karen Sasine
DESCRIPTION:Note: REGISTER ONLINE at linda@lindapannullomosaics.com \nCreate a 4″ x 4″ smalti flower mosaic with a tinted thinset background.\nGain a wealth of knowledge in 1 fun-filled day!\nYou will create a mini flower mosaic out of smalti\, filati\, millefiori and more.\nLearn how to shape smalti and other materials using a hammer\, hardie\, & nippers. Effectively use thinset as an adhesive and colored thinset as a background.\n1 hour lunch break – bring your own or visit Piccolina\, the Italian restaurant inside our building or other local establishments.\nAll tools and materials provided. All levels welcome!!\nAges 18+\, moderate hand strength needed \nREGISTER ONLINE at linda@lindapannullomosaics.com
