SUMMARY:Dimensions in Mosaic (3 days) with Karen Sasine
DESCRIPTION:Note: REGISTER ONLINE at linda@lindapannullomosaics.com \nLearn new techniques to upgrade your skills by adding dimension using 3-D effects & tinting thinset standards. Understand how to shape smalti with hammer\, hardie & nippers. Karen shares her essential tips and tricks from her many years as a mosaic artist.\nAges 18+\, moderate hand strength needed\n1 hour lunch break – bring your own or visit Piccolina\, the Italian restaurant inside our building (Sat\, Sun) or other local establishments. \nMaterials include:\n~ an extensive line of smalti with colors picked out for your piece\n~smalti will be in a & b cuts\n~ full line of filati\n~ extensive millefiori collection\n~ gold pops\n~ 9″ x 9″ shadow box frame\n~ the best nippers\n~ hammers & hardies\n~ all of her favorite tools supplied for each student\n~ laticrete platinum 254 thinset\n~ rainbow colorants for tinted thinset & background\n****You & Karen will talk 2 weeks in advance about your piece selection and preferred color palette \nREGISTER ONLINE at linda@lindapannullomosaics.com
URL:https://www.riverartsdistrict.com/event/dimensions-in-mosaic-3-days-with-karen-sasine/
